#Smart Home Sensor Hub

A progressive embedded C++ project where I build a smart home 
sensor hub from Arduino sketches down to bare-metal drivers.

##hardware

- Arduino nano
- STM32 Blue Pill (for Phase 3+, real bare-metal)
- DHT22 (temp/humidity)
- PIR sensor (motion)
- ====unavailable// BH1750 (light, I2C)


